&lt;li&gt;Bring a structured customer-centric thought approach and proven ideation and iteration process to Contentful that is based on TAM best practice as well as experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make recommendations about how to best leverage design knowledge and expertise within the internal teams and more broadly in your Customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for multiple work streams and strategically leverage resources to achieve goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain and foster key client relationships and always ensure both parties are aligned in terms of goals and ambitions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate openly and frequently to teammates, internal stakeholders and leaders about risks and opportunities within your Customer base as well as opportunities for Contentful to further enhance its portfolio to Customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buildup and develop a considerate, customer-focused Technical Account Management methodology that evolves through iterative processes and customer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our overarching desire to see our customers succeed through growth and adoption endeavors and lead at least 2 initiatives in this area eg: adoption mapping, OKRs, maturity models, playbooks, training etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor, guide, nurture some of our finest talent on what it takes to really be the advocate in the field for our customers. This will see you partner with the likes of our talented, passionate Support Engineers and expand their toolbox.&lt;/li&gt;
