&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple customer engagements at once and context-switch effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to meet goals, deadlines and key milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a similar technical consulting, Solution Engineer, Solution Architect or Implementation Manager role at a SaaS company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, and confidence conveying knowledge to a technical audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What would be advantageous, but not essential, is experience in any of the following programming languages: JavaScript, Ruby, Node.js, .NET, Swift, Java or Python, and an understanding of these web technologies: JS frameworks such as React, static site generators such as Gatsby, REST APIs, CMSs, CDNs, or experience with mobile development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
